OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA partly cloudy start, perhaps
OL,6,Fwith some pockets of fog. Some rain
OL,7,Fpossible across the north initially,
OL,8,Fthough drier later. A dry and bright
OL,9,Fafternoon, with some sunny intervals.
OL,10,FA gentle westerly breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIncreasingly cloudy with
OL,13,Fspells of rain moving in from the
OL,14,Fsouth through the evening, and
OL,15,Fovernight. Rain will become heavy and
OL,16,Fpersistent, especially in western
OL,17,Fparts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
