OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy with rain through much
OL,6,Fof Tuesday, this heavy over western
OL,7,Fparts. The best of any drier spells in
OL,8,Fthe east. Breezy.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,11,FLargely cloudy Wednesday with heavy
OL,12,Frain and strong winds moving westward.
OL,13,FDrier and brighter Thursday with light
OL,14,Fwinds and sunny spells. Heavy showers
OL,15,Fand gales Friday. Temperatures near
OL,16,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
